Lena's LSP-based features require Lean version 4 to be @uref{https://lean-lang.org/install/manual/, installed}.

Lena is not on Melpa yet. The @code{nael} and @code{nael-lsp} packages on @uref{https://melpa.org/#/nael, Melpa} are upstream
Nael, without Lena's additions.

