@node Lena not released yet
@section Lena, not released yet

@itemize
@item
Based on Nael 0.8.3, and renamed from Nael to Lena. See @emph{What It Adds} in the chapter @emph{Lineage and Credits}. The versions below are Nael's, by Mekeor Melire.
