@node Version 082 from 2026-02-22
@section Version 0.8.2 from 2026-02-22

@itemize
@item
Improved rules for Font-Lock: Highlight identifiers in their definitions. For example, in “def foo : Nat := 123”, @samp{foo} will be highlighted (via Font-Lock).
@end itemize

@node Version 080 from 2026-12-16
@section Version 0.8.0 from 2026-12-16

@itemize
@item
Fix bugs related to automatic abbreviation expansion:
@item
Backslash-dot-space now correctly expands to middledot-space, all while the cursor is positioned after the space character.
@item
Adjacent abbreviations expand correctly, i.e. backslash-dot-backslash expands the first abbreviation, resulting in middledot-backslash.
@item
Two abbreviations have been dropped, namely backslash and plus-space.
@end itemize

@node Version 070 from 2025-12-15
@section Version 0.7.0 from 2025-12-15

@itemize
@item
Remove the @code{nael-markdown} package. Move its code into @code{nael} package instead. (Wrapped into @code{with-eval-after-load}.)
